    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Now, you can easily compare multiple product in woocommerce shop. Just add active the plugin then put shortcode in a page.</p>\n<p>Now, customer will see a compare button with all product, and will see the compare page with all other products.</p>\n<h3>Features:</h3>\n<p><strong>Shortcode</strong> Paste [pcwc_comparison/] shortcode to a page and see the product compare table.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Modern Way:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Dashboard &#8220;Add New Plugin&#8221; section.</li>\n<li>Search For &#8220;AsCode Woo Calculator&#8221;. </li>\n<li>Install, then Activate it.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Old Way:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>AsCode Woo Calculator</code> to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0-beta</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial beta.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Product compare for woocommerce.",
